  "body": "SchemaCrawler  release at last commit e48d9b871f02bf9f080d12e26118d1acb6df9806\nSee the change history at https://www.schemacrawler.com/changes-report.html\n\n\n## What's Changed\n* Bump chainguard-dev/actions/setup-gitsign from 1.6.33 to 1.6.34 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/schemacrawler/SchemaCrawler/pull/2485\n* Remove schemacrawler-offline module and make a lightweight offline connector by @sualeh in https://github.com/schemacrawler/SchemaCrawler/pull/2486\n* v17.15.1 by @sualeh in https://github.com/schemacrawler/SchemaCrawler/pull/2487\n\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/schemacrawler/SchemaCrawler/compare/v17.15.0...v17.15.1",
